  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "MOVEMENT WITH LINES\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 2, CC 97 to 112\n   1 Size of gesture\n   2 Stillness\n   3 Blink\n   4 Anticipation\n   5 Leads the move\n   6 Facial expression\n   7 Eye darts\n   8 Posture\n   9 Touch\n  10 Walk and talk\n  11 Business with a prop\n  12 Move on the line\n  13 The listener's body\n  14 suite: The walk and talk\n  15 suite: Busy hands\n  16 suite: The task falls apart\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 3, CC 1 to 16\n   1 suite: Freeze on the line\n   2 suite: The real reaction\n   3 suite: Thinking face\n   4 suite: Stage-size acting\n   5 pair: When a big line lands, the body freezes\n   6 pair: When the speaker gets closer to the truth, the listener leans in\n   7 pair: When the anger rises, the task gets rougher\n   8 pair: When the task falls apart, a laugh comes\n   9 pair: When they walk and talk, the shots get longer\n  10 pair: When the wind-up is big, the body stretches far on the release\n  11 pair: When the eyes keep darting, the character reads as nervous\n  12 pair: When the eyes snap to something, the eyes lead the turn\n  13 pair: When a character stops blinking, they become unsettling\n  14 pair: When a touch is held, the beat turns tender\n  15 pairs: The body tells the line\n  16 pairs: Comic business\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 3, CC 17 to 17\n   1 pairs: The eyes give it away"
   },
   "pos": [
